-- Burning Steppes (zone 46), spawn layout 3/4: hand-picked deletes and the rares.
--
-- Firegut Ogre 7033 x14: no retail spawn (both TDBs); 13 stand 0.3-3 yd from Firegut Brute / Ogre Mage spawns, 6568 is the
-- pool 224 placeholder. Wild Turkey 32820 x15 (Pilgrim's Bounty): stand exactly on spirit-healer and Midsummer celebrant spots.
-- Midsummer: the layer was imported twice; the 369xxx/370xxx copies stand on their 352xxx twins (0 yd, same entry, same event 1),
-- and bonfire 352728 floats 18 yd above its twin 369963 at -7597,-2086 (terrain 125.6). Deathmaw 318105: 5.5 yd from the pooled
-- 52232, outside the pool, so two could be up. 6568's waypoint path goes with it. Sourced: both TDBs (none of these). Dossier S5 3.4 Parts B, D.
-- Rares (Part C): each rare in one pool, one up at a time, every spawn of it in the pool (most of the non-pooled copies are in the
-- 5.x sniff bands); placeholders gone (6485, 6568 deleted in _20 / here). New pools 3135200 Hahk'Zor, 3135201 Gorgon'och (plan
-- Q5b default: Gorgon'och kept, pooled). Ours: pooling (no TDB spawns rares) and equal chances.

